      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middlebury_Township%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tioga State Forest spills into southwestern Middlebury Township, offering hikers a glimpse of the region’s natural beauty.",
